            <ArticleTitle>Stent-graft repair of peroneal arteriovenous fistula.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>133-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Arteriovenous fistulas (AVFs) are infrequently seen in the civilian health-care system; traditionally, these lesions have been treated with ligation, or direct surgical repair with concomitant revascularization. We describe a rare case of a peroneal AVF treated with a stent-graft.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
